WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.400
This is Jace Morgan.

2
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.900
He's fifteen, he's funny, and his phone never leaves his hand.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Jace thinks he's a pretty good person.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.100
His mom thinks he's at the library.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.900
He isn't.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.600
His friend Maya keeps inviting him to youth group.

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.900
He keeps laughing it off.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.900
And the video he posted of Eli?

9
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.800
It's going viral.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.200
Hello?

11
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.400
Where am I?

12
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.800
Where's my phone?

13
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.600
You won't need it, Jace.

14
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:59.200
Everything on it, and everything that never was, has already been saved.

